0..82 Comment "// `Path.step(p, q)` moves `p` along `q` in `y. Path(A, a, y)`, and that transport"
83..160 Comment "// appends on its first word whatever `q` is: the empty word is the unit, and"
161..233 Comment "// a letter stays first (#422). Two definitions whose composites are one"
234..302 Comment "// transport, stuck on its two parameters, name one path (#440). The"
303..377 Comment "// composite and its unit laws are the HoTT book\'s Lemmas 2.1.2 and 2.1.4."
379..393 Comment "// The circle."
